    "findings": [
      "The accepted retirement removes first-party Research/Code Review routes and views, not M05 memory entities or source contracts. Core research storage/commands remain. The finite supported-preset API refuses new retired layouts while saved legacy forms remain readable.",
      "App changes only native returned-thread selection readiness; existing select() remains the operation. Project memory panel/preparation/exclusion integration is preserved.",
      "Server changes only the retired Research HTTP registration. Authenticated M05 endpoints, source bindings and CSRF checks remain.",
      "Inventory exactly applies accepted-main removals and additions while retaining all61 M05 source and12 runtime additions. The new guard test is declared.",
      "The guard repair modifies a dedicated cold Hermes startup allowance. No memory activation, provider/account egress, grant, PS1 predicate or native Save policy is changed."
    ]
